        {
          "id": "7lfl6xm4vmlq",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "In order to increase the stability and scalability of our systems, we are performing scheduled maintenance on the current On-Prem Forwarder infrastructure which is being decommissioned. We will be turning off the legacy On-prem forwarders and migrating to new IP ranges. From February 17th - 20th the On-prem forwarder will be disabled for 6 hours, then re-enabled affecting webhook deliveries (both Event Webhooks and Inbound Parse). Customers who haven't allowlisted our new IP ranges will see all their webhook posts delayed and eventually fail during that 6 hour timespan.\n\nThank you for your patience through this maintenance.",
          "incident_id": "lkzxs32z10d4",
          "created_at": "2026-02-17T11:55:30.333-08:00",
